B = [
('DeLorean','North America','1980s','cars','In the style of DeLorean, raw, futuristic, unpainted retro-science-fiction design. Surfaces are bare brushed stainless metal with a fine linear grain, left unpainted and cool silver grey, set against matte black plastic trim and dark charcoal fills. Forms are flat, wedge-like and razor sharp, built from straight edges, hard creases and slanted planes with no soft curves. Slim horizontal louvre patterns and recessed slots add rhythm. The emblem is a chunky rounded-rectangle monogram of three bold block letters stacked over a small spaced wordmark, in raised or etched metal. Lettering is wide, geometric and blocky. Accents are minimal, tiny warm orange or red points on an otherwise monochrome steel and black palette.'),
('Nissan','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Nissan, sleek, modern Japanese design built on a clean ring emblem with a horizontal name bar across its centre, drawn as a thin line outline and often shown in polished chrome, brushed silver or a flat two-dimensional black and white version. Forms are sharp yet flowing, with boomerang and V-shaped motifs, crisp folded creases, muscular swelling surfaces and floating, blacked-out contrasts. Palette is pearl white, deep graphite, silver, gloss black and a confident signal red, sometimes with a single copper or orange accent. Finishes mix mirror chrome, satin metal and glossy piano black. Lettering is wide, evenly spaced, thin geometric capitals. Light-edged glowing outlines and minimal digital graphics give a calm, high-tech feel.'),
('Datsun','East Asia','1970s','cars','In the style of Datsun, cheerful, honest, retro Japanese design built around a bold roundel emblem. A red circle sits behind a solid blue horizontal band that carries the white capital name, framed by a thin white or chrome outline. Palette is primary red, royal blue, cream white, sunny yellow, mustard and orange with warm off-white paper tones, often as flat colour blocks with thick stripes. Shapes are rounded, compact and friendly with small shields, pennants and crest forms. Lettering is chunky, slightly rounded, upright sans-serif capitals, also set in condensed Americana type. Materials include enamelled tin, painted metal, chrome-edged plates, felt patches and glossy printed paper with a gently worn, nostalgic patina.'),
('Lexus','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Lexus, precise, sharp-featured Japanese luxury. The emblem is a tall angular letter L inside a smooth oval ring, rendered in polished silver chrome with soft gradients and beveled edges, or in flat black line form. Surfaces are impeccably finished, with razor-sharp creases, deep sculpted folds, fine woven mesh and knurled metal textures in repeating geometric patterns. Palette is liquid silver, deep obsidian black, pearl white, burgundy red, deep blue and muted bronze. Finishes are mirror gloss, satin aluminium, lacquer and stitched leather. Lettering is wide, elegant, widely tracked capitals with long horizontal proportions. The overall mood is dramatic, refined, tailored and futuristic, with attention to micro detail.'),
('Suzuki','East Asia','1980s-2000s','cars','In the style of Suzuki, compact, practical Japanese design with a bold, sharply angled letter S emblem made from two opposing pointed strokes, in vivid red with a deep blue wordmark beneath. Palette is red, cobalt blue, white and bright yellow label tones, with dependable greys, black and cheerful pastel accents. Shapes are small, tall, sturdy and friendly, with simple squared-off forms, gently rounded corners and clear flat panels. Lettering is a wide, heavy, evenly spaced angular sans-serif in capitals, sometimes in a slanted sporty version. Finishes are matte plastic, painted enamel, ribbed rubber and sticker-like flat graphics. Reflective chrome versions of the emblem and bold racing-style decals add a lively, energetic touch.'),
('Hyundai','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Hyundai, futuristic, digital, geometric design. A slanted letter H inside an oval is drawn as a slim, cleanly spaced outline, and a newer version builds a tall H from sharp, parametric strokes. Pixel motifs recur everywhere, in small square dot grids, blocky eight-bit letterforms and chunky mosaic patterns. Surfaces are taut and folded like sharp paper origami, with crisp creases and flush smooth planes. Palette is deep navy, cool silver, glossy white, graphite, with neon accents of magenta, electric cyan and sunset orange that glow. Finishes are satin metal, translucent smoked glass and matte ceramic. Lettering is clean, wide, thin geometric sans-serif capitals. Overall, a clean, optimistic, high-tech and slightly playful look.'),
('Kia','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Kia, youthful, confident, sharp modern design. The emblem is a bold, flat, connected wordmark of three joined letters drawn as one rhythmic continuous stroke with slanted, sharp-angled cuts, in black, white or vivid red, replacing an older oval ring version in chrome. Shapes are crisp, sculpted and sporty, with taut sharp lines, tiger-like pointed motifs and star-map dot patterns. Palette is signal red, jet black, clean white, cool grey and midnight blue, with bold two-tone colour blocking and the occasional bright lime or orange accent. Finishes are gloss black, satin metal and soft-touch matte. Lettering is slanted, heavy, geometric, smooth and modern with a dynamic forward lean.'),
('Mitsubishi','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Mitsubishi, tough, bold, motorsport-ready Japanese design built on a symmetrical emblem of three red diamonds meeting at their points to form a sharp triangular mark. It is always flat, solid and graphic in scarlet red on white or reversed in white or chrome on black. Shapes are angular, faceted and rugged, with diamond and rhombus cut-outs, aggressive creases and slanted edges. Palette is hot red, white, black, silver and gunmetal grey, with occasional rally-style blue and yellow stripes. Finishes are matte black, brushed steel and glossy enamel. Lettering is wide, heavy, evenly spaced capitals in a bold sans-serif. Technical sport decals, chevrons and diamond repeats make a strong, corporate, geometric pattern.'),
('Lada','Russia and Eastern Europe','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Lada, frugal, sturdy, Soviet-era design. The emblem is a stylised sailing ship in a rounded shield or oval, drawn in chrome or white on a deep red or royal blue field, with an angular letter L inside it. Shapes are plain, squared-off and utilitarian, made of flat panels with minimal ornament. Palette is faded orange, mustard yellow, olive green, brick red, cream, sky blue and warm brown, as flat uncoated colour blocks and bold stripes. Finishes are painted enamel, thin chrome trim, stamped metal and worn printed paper with a nostalgic, sun-faded patina. Lettering is chunky, slightly italic, upright Cyrillic-inspired capitals and a slanted script wordmark in flat white.'),
('Holden','Oceania','1970s','cars','In the style of Holden, tough, proud Australian design built around a heraldic lion emblem. A rampant lion stands upright on a rolling stone, drawn in solid bold red or black silhouette, often inside an oval or shield with the capital name beneath. Palette is signal red, black, white, silver and sunburnt tones such as gold, burnt orange and dusty tan. Shapes are strong, muscular and flat with bold stripes and thick colour blocks. Finishes are enamelled tin, cast metal, chrome and flat, slightly weathered painted surfaces. Lettering is heavy, wide, slab-like capitals, in sturdy, no-nonsense proportions. Retro tin-sign treatments with scuffed edges, rivets and a lightly rusted patina give a rugged, confident heritage feel.'),
]
